The upstream evaluator is copied unchanged and verified by SHA-256. This cookbook
adds bounded report tools, a managed model loop, packaging and reward publication.
The native execution result comparison is preserved. Tool-enabled results are an
adaptation and should not be presented as unchanged FinQANet leaderboard results.

Repository MIT licensing does not independently establish rights to every original
financial report. Preserve source IDs/provenance and assess original document rights
for your intended use. The cookbook does not redistribute original report PDFs.
